{"Moving `b.cacheMu.Lock()` to after index creation allows concurrent `BuildIndex` calls for the same `NamespacedResource` key. Both goroutines will execute `bleve.New(dir, mapper)` with the same filesystem path, which bleve does not support\u2014this will either fail or corrupt the index. For memory-only indexes, the second `b.cache[key] = idx` silently overwrites the first index without closing it, leaking resources.": 0.8809803128242493, "When `s.blob.PutResourceBlob` returns `(nil, err)`, the code attempts `rsp.Error = AsErrorResult(err)` on a nil `rsp`, causing a panic. `PutResourceBlob` returns `nil, err` in multiple error paths (e.g., missing content value, `getBlobPath` failure).": 0.37941768765449524}